# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:product_expiry.field_product_product__expiration_time
#, []
msgid ""
"Number of days after the receipt of the products (from the vendor or in "
"stock after production) after which the goods may become dangerous and must "
"not be consumed. It will be computed on the lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Broj dana nakon prijema proizvoda (od dobavljača ili na skladištu nakon "
"proizvodnje) nakon kojih roba može postati opasna i ne smije se konzumirati."
" Izračunava se na osnovu lot/serijskog broja."

# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:product_expiry.field_product_product__alert_time
#, []
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which an alert should be "
"raised on the lot/serial number. It will be computed on the lot/serial "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Broj dana prije datuma isteka nakon kojih se podiže upozorenje za "
"lot/serijski broj. Izračunava se na osnovu lot/serijskog broja."

# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:product_expiry.field_product_product__removal_time
#, []
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which the goods should be "
"removed from the stock and not be counted in the Fresh On Hand Stock "
"anymore.It will be computed on the lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Broj dana prije datuma isteka nakon kojih bi roba trebala biti uklonjena sa "
"skladišta i više se ne računa u svježe stanje na skladištu. Izračunava se na"
" osnovu lot/serijskog broja."

# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:product_expiry.field_product_product__use_time
#, []
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which the goods starts "
"deteriorating, without being dangerous yet. It will be computed on the "
"lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Broj dana prije datuma isteka nakon kojih roba počinje propadati, a još "
"uvijek nije opasna. Izračunava se na osnovu lot/serijskog broja."

# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:product_expiry.field_stock_quant__available_quantity
#, []
msgid ""
"On hand quantity which hasn't been reserved on a transfer and is still "
"fresh, in the default unit of measure of the product"
msgstr ""
"Količina na zalihi koja nije rezervisana za transfer i još je svježa, u "
"zadanoj jedinici mjere proizvoda"

